# Crumb CLI — Command Test Plan

Status: [x] done  [ ] pending

## Commands
- [x] task add (multiple args) + list (no args)
- [x] task clear safety (single `clear` no-op, `clear clear` wipes)
- [x] done <id> marks task done (+ missing id handled)
- [x] cancel <id> marks task canceled (+ no-args handled)
- [x] delete <id> removes task (+ no-args handled)
- [x] clear clear wipes all tasks (+ no-args handled)
- [x] idea add (multiple) + list (no args)
- [x] note add (single) + list + multi-arg guard
- [x] next set / clear / show / multi-arg guard

## Helpers / utils
- [x] GenerateShortId (3-char hex, randomness)
- [x] FormatStatus (all status branches)

## Store
- [x] ReadData missing file -> empty struct
- [x] WriteData round-trip (write then read back)
- [x] Update applies mutation and persists
- [x] GetDbPath override redirect (temp dir)

## Layout
- Tests live in `tests/` package (black-box) — NOT inside cmd/ or store/.
- Run with: `go test ./...`
